window.products.push({"id":102192,"name":"HOMEE Milk Frothing Pitcher, Pointy Mouth Fancy Stainless Steel Milk Frothing Pitcher with Latte Art Pen for Coffee Shop and Domestic, 600 ml/20 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pnqlfOglL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The maximum capacity of our latte cup is 600ml, with a measurement engraved inside, you can engrave the volume according to your needs, and then apply the art of latte on your coffee. You can rest assured to choose our products, our products are made of food-grade stainless steel, step by step for your safety considerations. Of course, what is different from the previous version is that this product is also equipped with a garland needle, which can help with operations such as mixing agglomerated milk powder. The reasons for choosing our MILK FROTHING PITCHERS: 1. Our products are light enough so that you won't be unable to hold and make an unbeautiful pattern during the drawing process. 2. This premium milk frothing pitcher could quickly creates rich froth for all your favorites such as cappuccino, latte and etc. The frothing pitcher is easy to create coffee drinks with delicious foam. 3. The scaled design allows you to do whatever you want, no need to equip an additional measuring cup to measure, making the operation easier. 4. It’s a best choice to let it be a gift for your friends who are going to open a newly cafe shop. How to use？ 1. Heat the milk first, then put it into (notice: Don’t fill up) the MILK FROTHING PITCHER, then use an electric frother or manual froth according to your needs. 2. Pour the whipped milk froth into the coffee cup that holds the coffee until it is full. 3. You can use the decorating art pen to decorate your pattern to perfection. Specifications:Material: Stainless SteelSize: 13cm*9cm*11.1cm/5.1in*3.5in*4.4in Weight: 220 g/0.49 lbCapacity: 20 oz/600 mlColor: ChromeSurface: Mirror Finish Package includes: 1*Milk Frothing Pitcher 1*Latte Art Pen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pnqlfOglL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEE","source_asin":"B08X2CLMWD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X2CLMWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X2CLMWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
