window.products.push({"id":102347,"name":"50 Pack - Disposable Cold Brew Coffee Filter, 6\" X 4\", Ultra Fine Mesh, French Press Coffee Filters, Tea Filters, Iced Tea Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81alRnNpBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to use this disposable cold brew coffee bag? It is very easy to make cold brew coffee by this bag, it just needs 6 steps. 1. Fill the bag with coffee ground. 2. Bind the bag by the drawstring to keep coffee ground in the bag during the cold brew process. 3. Put the bag into a mason jar or a pitcher, then pour pure water into the container, the ratio of coffee ground to water is 1:10. 4. Put the container into the refrigerator for at least 24 hours. 5. Take out the bag and throw it away, you can get your homemade cold brew coffee. 6. Add ice, sugar or milk depends on your own taste, and enjoy your cold brew coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81alRnNpBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iAesthete","source_asin":"B07RTT2TS1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RTT2TS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RTT2TS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
