window.products.push({"id":102383,"name":"OEM W10240949 Washer Cold Water Inlet Valve W10240948 Washer Hot Water Inlet Valve by Beaquicy Replacement for Whirl-pool Ken-more Washing Machine Rep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MWfj5bPTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【CONTROL COLD AND HOT WATER】--- The cold water inlet valve W10240949 and the hot water inlet valve W10240948 are for washers, mainly used to control the cold and hot water flow into the washer and equalize the water temperature of the washing machine. OEM W10240949 cold water inlet valve is parts of the original manufacturer. 120V | 60Hz | Fits model specific top load washing machine. ✅【MADE OF PREMIUM MATERIAL】--- Includes 1 x W10240949 washer cold water inlet valve,1 x W10240948 washer hot water inlet valve.Each water inlet valve is made of high-quality ABS,metal and rubber, with reinforced threads, not easy to break,which can prolong the service life to the greatest extent.If the washing machine will have the following conditions,please the water inlet valve need to be replaced in time:①continuous water intake,②Inlet valve thread damaged,③the water inlet valve are leaking. ✅【730 DAYS WARRANTY】--- The W10240949 washing machine cold water inlet valve and W10240948 washing machine hot water inlet valve supports 730 DAYS return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping. ►W10240949 cold water inlet valve replaces W10921514, W11168740, WPW10240949, 4546379, AP6285450, 33390069, etc.►W10240948 hot water inlet valve replaces W10921515, W11168743, WPW10240948, 4585634, AP6327638, 33390068, etc. ✅【COMPATIBLE BRAND】--- Washer cold water inlet valve and W10240948 washer hot water inlet valve compatible with Kenmore, Whirlpool, Maytag Washer. ►W10240949 W10240948 water inlet valve Compatible with these models:11026002010, 11026002011, 11026002012, 11026012010, 11026012011, 11026012012, 11026112310, 7MWTW5500XW0, 7MWTW5500XW1, 7MWTW5500XW2, 7MWTW5550YW0, 7MWTW5550YW1, 7MWTW5550YW2, 7MWTW5560YW0, 7MWTW5700YW0, 7MMVWX500YW0, 7MMVWX500YW1, 7MMVWX500YW2, 7MMVWX510YW0, 7MMVWX510YW1, 7MMVWX550YW0, 7MMVWX655EW0, etc. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】--- Before replacing W10240949 W10240948 water inlet valve , disconnect the power and water source of the washing machine, and to complete this multi-step repair, you’ll need a screw driver and nut driver.Take photos as needed to ensure proper reassembly. Follow the YouTube repair video for the correct installation steps, which can save a lot of repair costs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MWfj5bPTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083FQY7CV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083FQY7CV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083FQY7CV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
