window.products.push({"id":102415,"name":"Jura CLEARYL Smart mini Water Filter Cartridge for ENA 8 Coffee Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lenJW7J8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Coffee is 98% water. So water of the highest quality is essential to creating the best possible coffee experience. The CLEARYL Smart mini from Jura revolutionizes water filtration. For the first time, thanks to modern RFID (Radio-frequency Identification) technology, a coffee machine can continually communicate with the filter. It recognizes whether a filter has been inserted and automatically activates the appropriate mode. It continually collects information about filter use and alerts the user when the filter capacity has been exhausted. Suitable for All Types of Mains Water CLEARYL Smart mini works according to the professional up-flow principle and always filters exactly the amount of water required for each preparation. Thanks to the pioneering formula, the filter cartridges are ideally suited to mains water anywhere in the world. The modified granule always filters limescale to an optimum level (even when the water hardness is low) and reduces the level of all harmful substances more efficiently than ever before. Minerals and fluorides that are important for helping flavors to develop are fully retained in the water. The optimum stabilization of limescale and efficient filtering of harmful substances always results in optimum water quality for a perfect coffee flavor. Automatic Filter Detection To enable the filter and coffee machine to communicate, Jura uses modern RFID technology. Any machine fitted with the intelligent water system (I.W.S.) recognizes when a filter is inserted, automatically switches to filter mode and starts the rinsing process. When the filter capacity is nearly used up the machine prompts the user to change the filter. If the filter is not changed, the machine activates descaling mode. After a certain amount of use, the user is prompted to descale the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lenJW7J8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura","source_asin":"B08CY3TNRD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CY3TNRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CY3TNRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
