window.products.push({"id":102563,"name":"Kegco HBK209B-3 Keg Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1049.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LelJHhxfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Homebrewers, this BF HBK209B-3 Triple Faucet Home Brew Kegerator from Kegco is the ideal beer dispensing option for you! It makes it easier than ever to store and tap up to three different kegs of home brewed beer, allowing you to show off a variety of flavors to your friends and family. Whether you're throwing a party for the big game, hosting a dinner or special occasion, or simply relaxing with a refreshing glass of beer at the tend of a long day, the HBK209B-3 will take serving your home-brewed beer to the next level. Kegco has included a specially designed three-product direct draw kit with this homebrew kegerator to give you everything you'll need to begin tapping and serving up to three home brew kegs at a time, including ball lock keg couplers, corrosion-resistant red CO2 tank, dual gauge regulator with 3-way air distributor, and three-faucet polished stainless steel draft tower. All you'll need to do is fill the CO2 tank and provide the kegs of beer! When it's not being used to store and serve delicious homebrew, this kegerator can be converted into a regular all-refrigerator or beverage cooler using the two included adjustable shelves. Adding to its versatility are four locking casters that allow it to be used in nearly any room in your home. A textured top surface with chrome guard rail helps prevent your mugs and glasses from sliding off while serving, and a dishwasher-safe flush-mount drip tray sits under the faucet to catch drips and spills for convenient clean-up. Thanks to the stainless steel floor plate that lines the bottom of the cooler, the weight of your kegs is evenly distributed, helping to prevent liner damage and ensure long-lasting performance. Running Amps: 1.7A.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LelJHhxfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kegco","source_asin":"B017II5MP4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017II5MP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B017II5MP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":102564,"name":"Sink Top Air Switch Kit Dual Outlet Turn On/Off Counter Top Air Switch Kit for Garbage Disposals (with SHORT PLOSHED BUTTON)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pU8V21leL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FOR FITTING】Choose the best fitting for your countertop. SHORT and LONG means the length of the air switch button, it depends on the thickness of the counter table you want to install on. In most cases, SHORT is for a stainless steel sink top and LONG is for thick countertop like granite, marble, quartz. The diameter of the countertop hole should be between 1 1/4\" and 1 3/4\". It is suitable for standard sinkhole for soap dispenser, otherwise you need to drill a hole by yourself. 【ADVANCED DESIGN】TWO INDEPENDENT OUTLETS, the front outlet is applied to garbage disposal (button controlled, one push on and one push off) , another outlet using for other devices like water heater, hot water dispenser or dishwasher is directly powered. 【EASY&SAFE】No tools are required for installation, It's easy to install with the instruction of manual. No wires, just plug power module to use, no damage to your wall, eliminates additional drilling and tedious installation. The Power-supply Cords are attested by UL for security and long-term use. Suitable for voltages from 110V to 130V. You can push button with wet hands, but remember to clean the button when all finished. 【EXCELLENT COMPATIBILITY】Our air switch can complement any Modern or Traditional Kitchen Faucet Design, With Most Popular Finishes, polished and brushed, keep a consistency of style with your faucet and sink, each finishes also have SHORT and LONG length. It can work with any brand of garbage disposals (≤2HP), perfectly well for Waste King, InSinkErator, Moen, GE and so on. 【EXTENDED POWER LINE DESIGN】 With extend power line, no longer limited to the botton of the sink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pU8V21leL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CLEESINK","source_asin":"B07G7797R7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G7797R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G7797R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
