window.products.push({"id":102638,"name":"Gome 4 Packs Washing Machine Pads for Anti Vibration with Honeycomb Pattern Design to Stops Washer Dryer Noise Moving Shaking Walking Skidding Protect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yZFfMtDVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique honeycomb pattern -- Gome unique honeycomb pattern pads can stick your machine to the floor and keep it in place even under the most unstable load. Superimposed use -- the unique hollow design at the bottom can make the two pads seamlessly connected to increase the height of the washing machine, which not only makes the washing machine drain more smoothly, but also facilitates cleaning of the dirt deposited under the washing machine. Stop walking and keep quiet -- using our rubber anti-vibration pads is the most effective way to solve the movement and noise of washing machines and dryers. Designed to achieve the best balance of floor grip, noise reduction and durability. Environmentally friendly materials -- High-quality rubber materials have undergone excellent tests in terms of safety and quality performance. The material is natural and does not produce unpleasant odors. Protect your floor -- Our washer and dryer bases prevent the floor from abrasion, scratches, or any type of damage. A simple solution can avoid a big and expensive problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yZFfMtDVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOME","source_asin":"B09J52RFQ8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J52RFQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J52RFQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":102639,"name":"Samsung DC92-01596D Main Control Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eupTXaHLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This high quality Genuine OEM Samsung Main Control Board (DC92-01596D) is a PCBA (Printed Ciruit Board Assembly) that manages the functions of the Dryer such as drying time and temperature. The Main Control Board is also called the PCB (Power Control Board) Assembly and is housed in plastic casing mounted on metal frame. Repair your appliance with confidence when you choose Genuine Samsung Factory Parts & Accessories. Please be aware that it is recommended to disconnect the appliance from all utilities prior to installation of the Main Control Board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eupTXaHLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B06Y3NDRZB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y3NDRZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y3NDRZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":102640,"name":"Washing Machine and Dryer Anti-Vibration Pads - Set of 4 Shock Absorber Anti-Slip Pads - 2.5\" Each with an Inner Diameter of 1.75\" - Keep Your Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LsgBa4AJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of the noise and vibration caused by your washing machine or dryer? Do you want to protect your floors and prevent damage to your appliances? If so, these anti-vibration pads are the solution you've been looking for. This set of four anti-vibration pads is compatible with most washing machines and dryers, and each pad measures 2.5 inches in diameter, with an inner diameter of 1.75 inches. The pads are made of high-quality rubber material that absorbs the shock and reduces the noise caused by the vibrations. Here are some of the benefits of using these anti-vibration pads: Shock absorber: The rubber material used in these pads is designed to absorb shock and reduce noise caused by vibrations. This means that your washing machine or dryer will operate much more quietly than before, making laundry day a more pleasant experience for everyone in your home. Anti-slip: The pads are designed to prevent your washing machine or dryer from slipping. This ensures that your appliances stay in place during use, reducing the risk of damage to your floors and protecting your appliances from unnecessary wear and tear. Easy to install: These anti-vibration pads are very easy to install. Simply place them under your washing machine or dryer and you're ready to go. They're compatible with most models, so you won't have to worry about finding the right size or shape. Durable: These pads are made of high-quality rubber material that is built to last. They're designed to withstand the weight of your washing machine or dryer without compressing or deforming over time, ensuring that you get the most out of your investment. Versatile: These anti-vibration pads can be used for more than just washing machines and dryers. They can also be used to reduce noise and vibration from other household appliances, such as refrigerators, air conditioners, and more. Affordable: These anti-vibration pads are an affordable solution to a common problem. They're much less expensive than replacing a damaged floor or a noisy appliance, and they're a simple way to improve the comfort and convenience of your home. Overall, if you're tired of dealing with a noisy washing machine or dryer, or you want to protect your floors and appliances from damage caused by vibrations, these anti-vibration pads are an excellent choice. They're easy to install, durable, versatile, and affordable, making them a great investment for any homeowner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LsgBa4AJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dependable Industries inc. Essentials","source_asin":"B01MXFAJGZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MXFAJGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MXFAJGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
