window.products.push({"id":102765,"name":"Chefman Reusable Coffee Filter for Single Brew K-Cup Makers Fits All RJ14-SKG Models, Stainless Steel & Mesh Pod Replacement, Compatible with Grounds ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zy0bYny-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the delicious taste of freshly brewed Coffee with the Chefman reusable coffee filters for single brew K-Cup Coffee makers. Compatible with all Chefman single brew Coffee makers, This filter is perfect for brewing a single cup of Coffee or loose leaf tea - just fill it up with desired grounds or Leaves, place it in the coffee machine, and brew! No more throwing away single-use pods - these Coffee filters are an alternative to single-serve coffee pods, as well as an easy and affordable way to make the perfect cup of Coffee straight from your kitchen. Maximize your purchase and master your kitchen with free, exclusive access to Club Chefman for a large assortment of recipes, guided tutorial videos, and more! Our products may contain plastics and/or other materials which have chemical compounds, Many of which are found in nature or are the byproduct of the manufacturing process itself. California proposition 65 Law requires manufacturers to notify their customers If a product contains any of the now 1, 000 Plus listed chemicals that may cause Cancer or reproductive harm (in the opinion of the State of California). Since the majority of manufacturing materials are made from various chemical compounds, It is impossible for manufacturers to produce products without at least one of the 1, 000 Plus listed chemicals being present in products. Chefman takes Product Safety and compliance to the law very seriously. As such, all Chefman products meet or exceed National and international standards for electrical and chemical safety. We are a socially responsible company and have therefore chosen to notify our customers in accordance with the California specific requirements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zy0bYny-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B082WBB5LF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082WBB5LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082WBB5LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
