window.products.push({"id":102768,"name":"Portable Washing Machine for Camping and RVs - Mini Washer - Easy to Use with Bucket - Suitable for Travel & Outdoors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JEW2jgcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you were ever wondering what to do with your dirty laundry when traveling or during business trips, our portable washing is your solution!It is both lightweight and easily portable thanks to our comfort handle. Features EASILY PORTABLE - The washing machine is 17 x 7 x 6 inches and weighs about 5.5 lbs, which means it is easily stored and extremely portable. You can take it with you anywhere you travel or have it in your RV when camping. Other uses may include dormitory life, or when you are on a business trip. CLEAN DESIGN - It has been designed so that it is intuitive on how to use. You can now easily wash your clothes. All you need is some detergent or laundry liquid, some water, and a bucket. Adjust the washer to the bucket and turn on the switch. STRONG HORSEPOWER - Our automatic mini washing machine is the equivalent of 150W. It comes with a comfort handle so you can move it easily. The laundry capacity depends on the bucket size you use, but we recommend around 6.5 lbs for maximum efficiency. It can be used to wash your favorite T-shirts, underwear, or dirty socks. Simply put it in and turn the horsepower on! TIME SAVER - Simply turn it on and come back after 15 minutes. That should be enough for most clothes unless it is an oily laundry that needs a bit more time. VENTILATION - The heat dissipation holes will help the washer stay cool so that it can be washing your clothes for long periods of time without overheating. The recommended usage time is between 15~30 minutes. NOTICES We do not recommend running the washing machine for more than 20 minutes at a time. Do not touch the clothing and water with your hand while the washing machine is working. The maximum water level must not be higher than the MAX mark of the washing machine. Be sure to take out coins, buttons, hairpins and other foreign bodies from pockets before washing your clothes. Do not wash","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JEW2jgcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Letusto","source_asin":"B08QMGDZN3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMGDZN3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMGDZN3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
