window.products.push({"id":102907,"name":"Commercial Ice Maker Machine Self Clean, 100lbs/24H Stainless Steel Ice Machine 45 Cubes/Batch in 11-18 Minutes with 33lbs Ice Storage Bin, Freestandi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V9gyNFy4L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"100lbs/24H with Larger Storage - Do you think the general ice maker is not enough to meet your needs of ice? FREE VILLAGE commercial ice maker machine produce 45 ice cubes per batch to meet your entire family ice cubes needs. 33 lbs ice storage container allows you to enjoy adequate ice all year round without worrying about ice cubes overflow. And 100 lbs daily ice output satisfies you with high demands of ice, being able to make 400 cups of ice drinks per day(approximately). Smart Operation with Advanced Panel - Our ice maker machine commercial is equipped with super advanced LCD panel, which can solve any function and any operation problem. You can adjust the size of ice cubes by adjusting the ice making time. Besides, our commercial ice maker has timer to set up delayed time for power on/off. Easy operation with detailed indicators allows you to enjoy your ice time intelligently. Automatic Cleaning - Extend the Life of Your Ice Maker - FREE VILLAGE recommends you clean the machine regularly according to the usage. Requires water supply and drain (GRAVITY DRAINAGE). SUGGEST-Drain water once a day (PULLING OUT THE SMALL HOSE ON THE RIGHT SIDE OF THE WATER TANK). Remember to keep the ice machine upright for at least 24 hours before using it. Press the \"Timer Clean\" button for over 5 sec to enter the \"Cleaning Program\" to clean it twice before making the first batch of ice. Efficient and Flexible - 45 clear hard cube-shaped ice cubes overall are ready in 11-18 minutes per batch. The less thickness of ice is, the faster ice making time does, and vice versa. Compare with specific ice time, our commercial ice maker is more flexible since the ice process duration can be adjusted randomly by the “+”and “-” button. You can change the ice making time according to your preference. Perfect for your home/indoor kitchen/bar/grocery store/restaurant,etc. Powerful & Safe for Commercial Use - With 15.3 x 14.6 x 31.4 inches and weight of 55.12 pounds, FREE VILLAGE commercial ice maker equips with strong 380W compressor, providing powerful capacity of intensive operation for more than daily use. Meanwhile, the ice maker is durable, safe and quiet because its body’s three-layer materials which is include food-grade ABS, thermal insulation and solid stainless cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V9gyNFy4L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREE VILLAGE","source_asin":"B09WTVSN57","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WTVSN57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WTVSN57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":102908,"name":"Dryer Thermostat Thermal Fuse Assembly Replacement for Samsung Dryer (DC96-00887A& DC47-00018A)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qLLKciFiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DC 47-00018A Product Description: This thermostat has a limit of 260 degrees Fahrenheit and a differential of 50 degrees. Meaning that with this thermostat, the heating element will cut out at 260 degrees and cycle back on once the internal temperature drops by 50 degrees. Brand: Whirlpool Estate Samsung Kenmore If the limit switch has blown, it might appear black or gray upon inspection. Also, your appliance likely has lost some of its capabilities. Even if you restore power to the appliance by resetting its main circuit breakers, tripped by the limit switch, the appliance might not heat properly. Only after you replace the switch will all of the appliance's typical competences return. Don't replace the switch until you identify the reason your appliance overheated and caused the switch to trigger; otherwise the issue might happen again. DC96-00887A Product DescriptionThe product fits with various Samsung brand models Please check the model before order. Note: The Compatibility Is Just For Reference. Please Compare The Part Number With Your Original One Before Purchasing! The picture can tell more than we can, what you see is what you will receive,please make sure it will fit your machine before bidding it. Please check pictures for more details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qLLKciFiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"spartshome","source_asin":"B07PGMGSK5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PGMGSK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PGMGSK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
