window.products.push({"id":102918,"name":"4392067 Repair Kit by Discount Parts Direct - Compatible with 27-in. Whirlpool Dryers - Replaces Part Numbers AP3109602, 2015, 4392067VP, 587637, 8004","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EJf-SAyML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PART NUMBER 4392067: This high-quality replacement part directly replaces part numbers 4392067, 2015, 4392067VP, 587637, 80047, AH373088, EA373088, AP3109602, and PS373088. WHERE TO USE: Use the dryer kit to replace all the wearable parts in your clothes dryer. The complete kit includes a drum belt, 4 drum support rollers, an idler pulley, 9 tri-rings, 1 washer, and an instruction sheet. FIT MOST WHIRLPOOL DRYERS: The kit is compatible with several 27-inch-wide Whirlpool manufactured dryers and thin twin laundry centers. Compatible brands include Kenmore/Sears, Maytag, KitchenAid, and Amana. Reach out to us to confirm compatibility with your appliance.(built after 2007) EASY TO FIX: Replacing all the wearable parts in your dryer takes about one to two hours. It’s an easy repair if you follow along with a repair video. Helpful tools include a quarter-inch hex head nut driver, a small flathead screwdriver, and work gloves. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: This high-quality kit meets all original manufacturer specifications for fit and performance. Please note that the drum belt does not fit all compatible dryer models. Compare the specific belt used in your appliance against this kit’s drum belt. Drum belt specs: 93.5L x 0.25W in. with 4 ribs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EJf-SAyML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Discount Parts Direct","source_asin":"B094FDFTGB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094FDFTGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B094FDFTGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
