window.products.push({"id":102977,"name":"Elitech GSP6 Temperature and Humidity Data Logger Recorder Monitor Temp Data Logger Indicator Thermometer Humidity Meters with External Probes Sensors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U6TircfnL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Updated: New packing started from June 2018 and updated humidity sensor, which is more accurate. This temperature and humidity data logger is mainly used for temperature and humidity recording during storage and transportation of foodstuff, medicine, chemicals and other products. Especially widely used in all links of warehousing, logistics and cold chain, such as refrigerated containers, refrigerated trucks, refrigerated package, cold storage, laboratory, etc.  The data logger conforms to GSP standard of new edition. It has one big LCD screen, a power button ,an external temperature sensor and an external humidity sensor. With two modes to save data: full record stop and cyclic record, the data logger has the function of over limit sound-light alarm. It can also automatically  shorten the record , interval in case of over temperature and humidity limit. Two pieces of built-in magnets are convenient to fix the data logger onto metal  material surface. Parameters: Temperature measuring range:-40℃~85℃/-40℉~185℉ Temperature accuracy：±0.5℃（-20℃~40℃；±0.1℃（other） Humidity range:10%~99% Humidity accuracy:±3%RH(25℃,20%~90%RH);±5%RH（other） Resolution :temperature 0.1℃,humidity 0.1%RH Record capacity:16000 points (max)(can be reset via software after full) Record interval :10sec~24 hour continuously set Data interface :USB Power supply :sigle-use 3.6V lithium battery or powered via USB Battery life: two years at room temperature with 15 minutes record interval and buzzer alarm disabled. Ambient temperature:-30℃~70℃.At low temperature environment , the LCD screen displays normal record but a little slowly . It will display data normally when the ambient temperature returns to normal. Package: 1x Temperature data logger 1x Temperature Sensor 1x Humidity Sensor 1x USB cable  1x A fixer with tape for humidity sensor  1x User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U6TircfnL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elitech","source_asin":"B074DC6ML8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074DC6ML8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B074DC6ML8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
