window.products.push({"id":102996,"name":"VBGK Electric cooktop 36 inch,Electric Stove burner,Built-in and Countertop Electric Stove Top, LED Touch Screen,9 Heating Level, Timer & Kid Safety L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":359.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q9vH6LsnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【220V- 240v Electric Radiant Cooktop 】:5 burner electric cooktop --2×1200W and 2×2000W and 2200W，240V/60Hz. The 5 burners LED Touch Screen. It can heat up quickly and help to prepare different delicious foods at the same time. Save time and energy. Whether it’s a weekend gathering or friends' visit, you can easily finish a big meal to entertain them. TIPS: The cooktop is without plug. Built-in Cooktop need to be conected to hard wired(220-240v). 【9 Level Setting Drop-in Electric Cooktop 】The electric cooktop 36 inch, equipped with 9 heat level settings allow range from melt to rapid boil, accurate and easy temperature changes at the touch of a button, boil, stew, fry, stir fry, switch from one mode to another as needed. The heating effect of the electric ceramic cooktop is the same as that of the gas stove, and the food made is as delicious as the gas stove. For All Cookwares: Our electric burner is compatible with almost all types of pots and pans with flat bottom, including glass pans, ceramic pots, stainless steel pans, aluminum pans, casserole, works and more. Friendly 2-in-1 design provides more options, you can use it on the countertop or build in your kitchen counter. Safe and Reliable: VBGK electric hot plate for cooking features multiple protection, such as overheat protection, residual heat indication, auto shut-off and child safety lock. The crystalline surface can resist high temperatures and is more durable to use. Customer Service: We offer an outstanding 30-day hassle-free return policy and 18 months free replacement. Any questions about your electric stove burners, please don’t hesitate to contact us for a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q9vH6LsnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VBGK","source_asin":"B09LSXPPZK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-102996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LSXPPZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LSXPPZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
